uthor_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.3.stable.mono.official [77dcf97d8]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600G with Radeon Graphics (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen accessing nodes using `GetNodeOrNull<class>`, if the class is custom (say, the class has a custom function the user needs), then the absolute path returns null. \r\nThis does not apply when the node is the starting scene of a project and is looked for by an autoloaded script.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an empty scene with one Node called \"parent\" and create a C# script for it.\r\n2. Add a child node, call it \"child\", and create another C# script. \r\n3. In the \"parent\" C# script, create a `_Ready()` method and within it, call `Child c = GetNodeOrNull<Child>(\"/root/parent/child\");`. After that, check `if (c == null)` and throw an error if so.\r\n4. The error should throw whenever the project is ran.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[getnode-null-4_3.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17590763/getnode-null-4_3.zip)\r\nWhen running the project, it gives an instance of `GetNodeOrNull<Child>` working with a relative path, and the same node not working with an absolute one.","closed_by":{"login":"Paperzlel","id":123300405,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1lqNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123300405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel","html_url":"https://github.com/Paperzlel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paperzlel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98705/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98705/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}